@baseUrl = http://localhost:5026

### 1. creating normal product (electrics = 1,  price from 50 to 50000) -> must be 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "LaptopDell15",
  "category": 1,
  "price": 3500,
  "stockQuantity": 10
}

### 2. cheking validation (short name + price > 500) -> must return 400 Bad Request with Name and Price
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "A!",
  "category": 2,
  "price": 999,
  "stockQuantity": 5
}

### 3. creating forbidden word "Fake" 
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/forbidden-phrases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phrase": "Fake"
}

### 4. trying to create forbidden word "Fake" -> must return 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "FakePhone12",
  "category": 1,
  "price": 500,
  "stockQuantity": 2
}

### 5. updating product (changing price from 3500 to 3200 and quantity from 10 to 8)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "LaptopDell15",
  "category": 1,
  "price": 3200,
  "stockQuantity": 8
}

### 6. cheking details of product ID=1 (inside "history" are changes in Price and StockQuantity!)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/1

### 7. short list (only Id, Name, Price)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products